{"id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-formula-instance.md","title":"Capture-Avoiding Simultaneous Formula Instance","display":"df-formula-instance — Capture-Avoiding Simultaneous Formula Instance","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-formula-instance","aliases":["92-df-formula-instance"],"display":"df-formula-instance — Capture-Avoiding Simultaneous Formula Instance","source":"第 II 章 pp. 16、18–19（PDF 33、35–36）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-formula-instance"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-formula-instance</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula-instance — Capture-Avoiding Simultaneous Formula Instance"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 pp. 16、18–19（PDF 33、35–36）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t=(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G^k\">\\(\\vec t=(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G^k\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> 是固定的三元无捕获代入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k\\)</span> 为下文定义的有限同时实例操作；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_i,H_i,w_i,B\">\\(F_i,H_i,w_i,B\\)</span> 是其递归计算的辅助记号，不是额外任选参数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\\quad\nB&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}\\mathrm{FV}_G(t_i)\\cup\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\},\\\\\nw_i&amp;\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N\\mid v_j\\notin B\\cup\\{w_h\\mid h&lt;i\\}\\}}\n\\quad(i&lt;k),\\\\\nF_0&amp;\\coloneqq F,\\qquad F_{i+1}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Subst}_G(F_i,w_i,v_i),\\\\\nH_0&amp;\\coloneqq F_k,\\qquad H_{i+1}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Subst}_G(H_i,t_i,w_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\vec t)&amp;\\coloneqq H_k.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\\quad\nB&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\cup\\bigcup_{i&lt;k}\\mathrm{FV}_G(t_i)\\cup\\{v_i\\mid i&lt;k\\},\\\\\nw_i&amp;\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N\\mid v_j\\notin B\\cup\\{w_h\\mid h&lt;i\\}\\}}\n\\quad(i&lt;k),\\\\\nF_0&amp;\\coloneqq F,\\qquad F_{i+1}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Subst}_G(F_i,w_i,v_i),\\\\\nH_0&amp;\\coloneqq F_k,\\qquad H_{i+1}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Subst}_G(H_i,t_i,w_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\vec t)&amp;\\coloneqq H_k.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两次有限递归均按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;k\">\\(i&lt;k\\)</span> 进行；新变量排除集有限，故最小下标存在。先改名到彼此不同、且不在任何代入项中的新变量，再代入，因此交换变量等情形不会误作顺序代入。例如同时把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(v_0,v_1)\">\\((v_0,v_1)\\)</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(v_1,v_0)\">\\((v_1,v_0)\\)</span>，不会把两个变量都变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})\">\\(\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})\\)</span> 是闭句。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时实例就是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>。这是原书实例记号的显式实现；原书变量从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1\">\\(v_1\\)</span> 起，本地改为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> 起。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 II 章 pp. 16、18–19（PDF 33、35–36）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t=(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{v_0,\\ldots,v_{k-1}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subst}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k","display":false},{"tex":"F_i,H_i,w_i,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula\\text{-}instance}\\vdash\\quad\nB&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\cup\\bigcup_{i<k}\\mathrm{FV}_G(t_i)\\cup\\{v_i\\mid i<k\\},\\\\\nw_i&\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{j\\in\\mathbb N\\mid v_j\\notin B\\cup\\{w_h\\mid h<i\\}\\}}\n\\quad(i<k),\\\\\nF_0&\\coloneqq F,\\qquad F_{i+1}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Subst}_G(F_i,w_i,v_i),\\\\\nH_0&\\coloneqq F_k,\\qquad H_{i+1}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Subst}_G(H_i,t_i,w_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\vec t)&\\coloneqq H_k.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"i<k","display":false},{"tex":"(v_0,v_1)","display":false},{"tex":"(v_1,v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k(F;\\overline{\\vec n})","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"v_1","display":false},{"tex":"v_0","display":false}],"bytes":2055,"backlinks":[{"id":"e5790b58acf0fb1c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k$ 来自[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]；$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k$ 来自[[92-df-formula-instance]]。"},{"id":"cb62be5b9aab48d1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^1$ 是[[92-df-formula-instance]]的实例操作；$\\mathrm{Diagonalizable}_G$ 是下文定义的内部固定点性质。"},{"id":"58d4ef04d6476ad5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^2$ 是[[92-df-formula-instance]]的二元实例操作；$\\mathrm{Enum}_{\\mathcal S}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$ 是下文定义的枚举关系。"},{"id":"a769d89316a99993","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"466c532d80d46a83","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"31cbbeaa392f6458","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9252d4105cc5f189","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9758d74f9a5e939a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^k$ 是[[92-df-formula-instance]]的无捕获实例操作；$\\mathrm{SRep}_{\\mathcal S}^k(F,A),\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^k(A)$ 是下文定义的公式表示关系及存在公式的集合性质。"},{"id":"be5eece035332f0c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NumDef}_{\\mathcal S}^{k+1}$ 来自[[92-df-complete-representability]]，$\\mathrm{Inst}_G^{k+1}$ 来自[[92-df-formula-instance]]。"},{"id":"00f528e893a47b3f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"82fce7dbd28f0125","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["元数据 · depends_o